{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Unblinking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mind-bending puzzle game where the line between reality and madness becomes blurred. Solve increasingly difficult puzzles and  prepare yourself to face the horrors lurking within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into Eldritch Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand on the edge of an unfathomable abyss, with the weight of mortality looming over you... a condemned death row inmate forced to play a twisted survival game, navigating a maze composed of cubes... but not just any cubes. On all six sides, they are each  adorned with unblinking eyes that stare back at you like cold calculating sentinels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Spark of Hope</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can successfully navigate this twisted, ever changing nightmare and recover the relic, you will be granted back your freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you overcome the eldritch horrors within Unblinking, or will you succumb to madness and despair? <i>You have only one way to find out.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 puzzles to break through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique, eldritch twist on traditional puzzle solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling atmosphere and sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly complex challenges as you delve deeper into the angel's body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, thought-provoking narrative that explores themes of mortality, madness, and redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your own avatar.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Completed the briefing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491290/7034273a264d15bb40718f0d62c352eb4500a45d.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Level